{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2021-10-12 14:00:00', 'title': "AMERICAN WATER'S CHERYL NORTON RECOGNIZED BY NEW JERSEY ALLIANCE FOR ACTION AND NJBIZ", 'text': "CAMDEN, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN WATER (NYSE: AWK), THE LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED U.S. WATER AND WASTEWATER UTILITY COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER, CHERYL NORTON, IS BEING HONORED AS THE RECIPIENT OF THE 2021 PRESIDENT'S AWARD FROM THE NEW JERSEY ALLIANCE FOR ACTION (NJAA) AND WAS ALSO SELECTED BY NJBIZ AS A BEST FIFTY WOMEN IN BUSINESS HONOREE. “I WANT TO CONGRATULATE CHERYL ON THESE WELL-DESERVED RECOGNITIONS,” SAID WALTER LYNCH, PRESIDENT AND CEO, AMERICAN WATER."}